# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Build output. Everything here is regenerated by a build; the shipped copies
# live in the GitHub Release archive, not in git.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
BookTextPlugin/build/
BookTextPlugin/build.log
# Configuring from the repo root (cmake -B build -S BookTextPlugin) puts the
# tree here instead. Both spellings are in the docs, so both are ignored.
/build/
BookTextPlugin/vcpkg_installed/
*.pex

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Release staging and archives (tools/package.ps1 rebuilds these).
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
dist_staging/
_pkg/
*.zip

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Local development notes. CLAUDE.md is the working design journal: it carries
# absolute paths from the machine it was written on and references to specific
# test runs, so it stays local.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
CLAUDE.md
_build/claude_md_old_pacing.md
.claude/

# Discord thread copy: the pinned OP (discord_op.md) and the per-release posts
# (release-v*.md). Drafts for a place outside this repo, superseded the moment
# they are pasted - the authoritative changelog is INSTALL.txt and the git tags.
_discord/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Third-party tooling that happens to sit in this working folder and is not
